Validate a level dump or export native stage pages as JSON

Usage: vize dump [OPTIONS] <--roundtrip <FILE>|--all-levels> [FILE]

Arguments:
  [FILE]  Raw Vue template to capture (.vue SFCs await the native container)

Options:
      --level <LEVEL>     L1 Vue-template source fidelity, or L2/L3 canonical Full dump bytes [possible values: l1, l2, l3]
      --roundtrip <FILE>  Read FILE and require byte identity after the selected level's roundtrip
      --all-levels        Capture L1, L2 and L3 pages from one native template ladder run
      --json              Write the stage feed as JSON
  -h, --help              Print help
